{"last_link_id": 96, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "abc", "links": [94], "label": "abc", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "abc"}], "size": [400, 420], "pos": [3008, -880], "widgets_values": ["", "", 1062344095758051, "randomize", "full", 8192, 0.7, 0.9, 30, 1.005, 100], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 64, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "style"}, "name": "style", "link": 82, "label": "style", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "style"}, {"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 84, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "link": 79, "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_abc_tokens"}, "name": "max_abc_tokens", "label": "max_abc_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_abc_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "repetition_penalty"}, "name": "repetition_penalty", "label": "repetition_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "repetition_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "penalty_window"}, "name": "penalty_window", "label": "penalty_window", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "penalty_window"}], "flags": {}, "id": 42, "type": "YuE2GenerateABC", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "YuE2GenerateABC"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [270, 140], "pos": [4398.76171875, -746.0946655273438], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 70, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "source"}], "flags": {}, "id": 49, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["# YuE2: Text to Music\n\nYuE2 is a music generation model that creates complete songs with vocals and instrumental accompaniment from a **music style** and **lyrics**.\n\nWith ABC Planning enabled, YuE2 first creates an editable symbolic music plan (melody and optionally chords), then generates the final audio from that plan.\n\n## Model Link\n\n- [Hugging Face:Comfy-Org/YuE2](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2)\n- [ModelScope:Comfy-Org/YuE2](https://modelscope.cn/models/Comfy-Org/YuE2)\n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2/resolve/main/checkpoints/yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors) (3.69 GB)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   └── 📂 checkpoints/\n│       └── yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n```\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Write a description of the music you want in **Style**.\n2. Enter your song lyrics in **Lyrics** using section tags such as `[Verse]` and `[Chorus]`.\n3. Choose a planning **Mode**.\n4. Set the **Max Duration**.\n5. Run the workflow to generate the song.\n\n## Writing the Style\n\nDescribe the main musical characteristics, such as:\n\n- **Genre:** pop, jazz, rock, electronic, folk\n- **Vocals:** warm female vocal, expressive male vocal, soft vocals\n- **Language:** English, Chinese, Japanese, etc.\n- **Tempo:** 90 BPM, slow, upbeat\n- **Instruments:** piano, electric guitar, bass, drums, synths\n\nExample:\n\n> English, warm female vocal, contemporary pop, 96 BPM, piano, rounded electric bass, restrained drums, clear diction\n\nKeep musical instructions in **Style** rather than in the lyrics.\n\n## Writing Lyrics\n\nUse section tags to describe the song structure:\n\n    [Verse]\n    Morning light across the window\n    City waking down below\n\n    [Chorus]\n    Run with me into the sunlight\n    Leave the shadows far behind\n\nYou can structure the song with sections such as:\n\n`[Verse]` · `[Chorus]` · `[Bridge]` · `[Outro]`\n\nPut only the words intended to be sung in the lyrics field.\n\n## ABC Planning\n\n**Full**\nCreates a symbolic plan with **melody and chords** before generating the song. Recommended for general text-to-music generation.\n\n**Melody**\nCreates a **melody-only** plan and allows the accompaniment to be generated more freely.\n\nDisable **ABC Planning** to generate music directly from Style and Lyrics without creating a symbolic plan.\n\n## Max Duration\n\nSets the **maximum** duration of the generated song in seconds.\n\nThe song may finish earlier depending on the generated musical structure and lyrics.\n\n## Prompt Guide\n\nFor better results, describe the musical intent clearly and keep Style and Lyrics separate:\n\n**Style**\n`Language + Genre + Vocal Character + Tempo + Instruments + Musical Characteristics`\n\n**Lyrics**\nUse section tags and provide only the words that should be sung.\n\n## Learn More\n\n- [YuE2 Generation Guide](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/docs/generation.md)\n- [YuE2 Music Skill](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/SKILL.md)\n- [Generation & Covers Reference](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/references/generation-and-covers.md)\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "About: YuE2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [902.6996459960938, 810.7448120117188], "pos": [847.560791015625, -845.9027099609375], "id": 40, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [96], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "size": [230, 60], "pos": [5086.751953125, -858.1139526367188], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 76, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 77, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "VAEDecodeAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudio"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [668.8715209960938, 261.453125], "pos": [5352.85546875, -857.5233764648438], "widgets_values": ["audio/YuE2", "flac"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 96, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "format"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "SaveAudioAdvanced", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioAdvanced"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [68], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [415.4993896484375, 110.53813171386719], "pos": [3438, -880], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source",